#Linux
Ijade kọ: (Aṣẹ ls -la), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: (Ọna /home gabor Desktop), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: (Ọna /root: ['my\\ documents'], business presentations), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: ((Aṣẹ ls: ['my\\ documents']) > ['list.txt']), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: ((Aṣẹ do: ['this'], ati: ['that'])), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: ((Ọna go: ['here'], ati: ['there'])), ila-tuntun.